==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 55 seconds<sup>1,650f</sup>, delay 30~50 seconds<sup>900f~1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.
**4 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 8~13 seconds<sup>240f~390f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The main threat here is the Shy Boy, though he is not boosted here. Bring good [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red]] and [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-Floating Cats]] such as [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]], or [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bath Cat]] to beat Shy Boy. Because of the peon spam, [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]] such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] can also work really well here. If you can handle the Shy Boy, then you can handle the Sir Seals and peons in this stage as well.

